},{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/obsproject/obs-studio/releases/assets/689998556\",\"id\":689998556,\"node_id\":\"RA_kwDOAMnsBs4pIIrc\",\"name\":\"OBS-Studio-33.0.1-Windows-x64-PDBs.zip\",\"label\":\"\",\"uploader\":{\"login\":\"github-actions[bot]\",\"id\":41898282,\"node_id\":\"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events\",\"type\":\"Bot\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"content_type\":\"application/zip\",\"state\":\"uploaded\",\"size\":65912719,\"digest\":\"sha256:f43a4360e894c952b97741d94dc3f1516a052ad7bf94ee2feaa5fd2a24bddc26\",\"download_count\":121,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-29T21:43:45Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-29T21:43:48Z\",\"browser_download_url\":\"https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/releases/download/33.0.1/OBS-Studio-33.0.1-Windows-x64-PDBs.zip\"},{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/obsproject/obs-studio/releases/assets/689998557\",\"id\":689998557,\"node_id\":\"RA_kwDOAMnsBs4pIIrd\",\"name\":\"OBS-Studio-33.0.1-Windows-x64.zip\",\"label\":\"\",\"uploader\":{\"login\":\"github-actions[bot]\",\"id\":41898282,\"node_id\":\"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events\",\"type\":\"Bot\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"content_type\":\"application/zip\",\"state\":\"uploaded\",\"size\":223786669,\"digest\":\"sha256:0d9436451c2d772b33428e3fdae9776f071895c335de17283176306fb72651d3\",\"download_count\":5261,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-29T21:43:45Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-29T21:43:55Z\",\"browser_download_url\":\"https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/releases/download/33.0.1/OBS-Studio-33.0.1-Windows-x64.zip\"}],\"tarball_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/obsproject/obs-studio/tarball/33.0.1\",\"zipball_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/obsproject/obs-studio/zipball/33.0.1\",\"body\":\"33.0.1 Hotfix Changes\\r\\n---------------------\\r\\n\\r\\n* Fixed a crash on startup when logged into a service integration [WizardCM] ([#554](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-browser/pull/554))\\r\\n* Fixed a crash when logging into the Twitch integration [WizardCM] ([#14072](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/14072))\\r\\n* Fixed a deadlock when logging into the YouTube integration [WizardCM] ([#556](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-browser/pull/556))\\r\\n* Fixed a race condition where browser panels could end up with incorrectly sized content [WizardCM] ([#558](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-browser/pull/558))\\r\\n* Fixed a memory leak when using the image slideshow source [prgmitchell] ([#14078](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/14078))\\r\\n* Fixed plugins failing to load on Flatpak [FiniteSingularity] ([#14103](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/14103))\\r\\n* Fixed Plugin Manager not prompting for save after a change until the dialog is re-opened [Warchamp7] ([#14112](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/14112))\\r\\n\\r\\n33.0 New Features\\r\\n-----------------\\r\\n\\r\\n* Updated CEF from 127/6533 to 150/7871 [WizardCM] ([#13900](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13900))\\r\\n  + This is a massive update to the underlying framework used for browser sources and docks from the July 2024 release to September 2026\\r\\n  + All of this work is on the backend and should be invisible to users. Please be sure to report any new weirdness or problems you run into with browser sources!\\r\\n* Complete overhaul to plugin loading [FiniteSingularity/PatTheMav] ([#13594](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13594))\\r\\n  + First-party plugins are now in a new folder named core\\r\\n  + Third-party plugins have an updated installation location and folder structure\\r\\n  + Existing third-party plugins will continue to load from the legacy locations until OBS Studio 34.0\\r\\n  + More information is available in our [knowledge base article](https://obsproject.com/kb/legacy-plugin-locations)\\r\\n* Improved how source snapping works in the preview [Warchamp7] ([#12298](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/12298))\\r\\n  + New visual indicator added\\r\\n  + Sources now snap along the entire axis instead of only when directly touching\\r\\n  + Sources no longer snap to hidden sources\\r\\n* Improved behavior of spinboxes for number values [Warchamp7] ([#12337](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/12337))\\r\\n  + Typing is no longer mysteriously blocked in some situations\\r\\n  + Numbers are no longer cut off in some situations\\r\\n  + Values now update only after pressing Enter and Enter does not close the window\\r\\n  + Holding Shift + Up/Down now advances multiple steps at a time\\r\\n  + Dragging the cursor inside the input but outside the text itself now works properly\\r\\n* Enabled NVENC on Arm64 [RytoEX] ([#13827](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13827))\\r\\n\\r\\n33.0 Changes\\r\\n------------\\r\\n\\r\\n* Added a check for encoders being missing when loading a profile [derrod] ([#11340](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/11340))\\r\\n* Added support for newest NVIDIA Broadcast SDKs for NVIDIA Audio Effects and Video Effects [pkviet] ([#13838](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13838))\\r\\n* Added hotkeys for controlling audio monitoring of a source [Warchamp7] ([#13599](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13599))\\r\\n* Changed Safe Mode to not start WebSocket Server [FiniteSingularity/RytoEX] ([#13984](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13984))\\r\\n* Fixed issues with groups in Studio Mode [Warchamp7] ([#11092](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/11092))\\r\\n  + Fixed moving sources inside a group causing them to glitch out in Program\\r\\n  + Fixed moving sources inside a group showing up live in Program\\r\\n* Adjusted naming of Window Capture methods on Windows [Penwy] ([#12047](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/12047))\\r\\n* Improved detection of fullscreen games for Game Capture [Kira-NT] ([#10880](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/10880))\\r\\n* Improved transparency handling for macOS Screen Capture [jcm93] ([#13030](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13030))\\r\\n* Scaled simple output recording audio bitrate by channel count [nickvonkaenel] ([#13311](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13311))\\r\\n* Removed support for Ubuntu 24.04 \\r\\n\\r\\n33.0 Bug Fixes\\r\\n--------------\\r\\n\\r\\n* Added a startup error if obs-transitions failed to load [notr1ch] ([#13321](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13321))\\r\\n* Improved file splitting for Hybrid MP4/MOV [derrod] ([#13386](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13386))\\r\\n* Fixed outputs getting stuck running when a bad rescale output resolution is set [suogesi] ([#13375](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13375))\\r\\n* Fixed monitoring icon state getting desynced when using third-party tools or websockets [prgmitchell] ([#13822](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13822))\\r\\n* Fixed a crash on macOS 27.2 when starting OBS Studio [RytoEX] ([#14070](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/14070))\\r\\n* Fixed potential crash when shader cache file is invalid [notr1ch] ([#13538](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13538))\\r\\n* Fixed a potential crash on Linux when USB mic is removed [R0te/RytoEX] ([#13922](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13922))\\r\\n* Fixed a potential crash when renaming a source with the Add Source window open [Warchamp7] ([#13800](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13800))\\r\\n* Fixed a potential deadlock during video/audio tasks [exeldro] ([#13579](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13579))\\r\\n* Fixed an issue with B-frame offset calculation in AMF that could cause streams to disconnect [lexano-ivs] ([#13762](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13762))\\r\\n* Fixed PipeWire screencast sources being duplicated in studio mode [tytan652] ([#13673](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13673))\\r\\n* Fixed a potential crash when switching off a newly created profile [Warchamp7] ([#13182](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13182))\\r\\n* Fixed a source toolbar crash when source type is missing [Penwy] ([#13539](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13539))\\r\\n* Fixed profile import failing on paths with a trailing slash [Ushkalovk] ([#13863](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13863))\\r\\n\\r\\n33.0 Developer Information\\r\\n--------------------------\\r\\n\\r\\n* Added frontend event and output signal for replay buffer saving [Penwy] ([#8955](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/8955))\\r\\n* Added guidance regarding the theme system to the top of all theme files [Warchamp7] ([#13733](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13733))\\r\\n* Added ability to set a file extension filter for OBS_PATH_FILE_SAVE path types [FiniteSingularity] ([#10190](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/10190))\\r\\n* Added obs_frontend_is_safe_mode for first-party plugins\\r\\n  + Third-party plugins are not loaded at all in Safe Mode\\r\\n* Added versions to Flatpak plugin extension point [tytan652] ([#13735](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13735))\\r\\n* Added obs_canvas_video_active() to check if the video of a canvas is active [exeldro] ([#13110](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13110))\\r\\n* The minimum supported versions of Visual Studio, Windows SDK, and clang-format have been increased. Previous versions may continue to work, but will no longer be tested/supported. It is recommended that build environments are kept up-to-date with the project's toolchain.\\r\\n  + Changed Windows builds to use Visual Studio 2026 and SDK 26100 [RytoEX] ([#13543](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13543))\\r\\n  + Changed clang-format version used to 22.1.3 [PatTheMav] ([#13549](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13549))\\r\\n* Changed obs_canvas_reset_video() to allow resetting a canvas's video when any other canvas's video is active, but not its own video [exeldro] ([#13110](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13110))\\r\\n* Updated libnsgif to 1.0.0 [RytoEX] ([#11178](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/11178))\\r\\n  + This is a breaking change for any plugins using libobs/graphics gs_image_file\\r\\n* Clarified documentation for obs_module_unload [notr1ch] ([#13327](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13327))\\r\\n* Required MbedTLS 3 and exclude 4 or later [tytan652] ([#13799](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13799))\\r\\n* Removed support for FFmpeg 6.x and 7.x [RytoEX] ([#13964](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13964))\\r\\n* Removed support for Qt 6.4-6.9 [RytoEX] ([#13969](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13969))\\r\\n* Fixed repeated preview enable/disables not working [WarmUpTill] ([#12580](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/12580))\\r\\n* Only emit core signal handlers for public canvases [tt2468] ([#13574](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13574))\\r\\n* Deprecated unused hidden API for sources [derrod] ([#13122](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13122))\\r\\n* Deprecated APIs for audio source monitoring_type [Warchamp7] ([#13599](https://github.com/obsproject/obs-studio/pull/13599))\\r\\n  + This is replaced by a new monitoring_enabled boolean\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n### Checksums\\r\\n    OBS-Studio-33.0.1-Sources.tar.gz: c8d3a8f69a0f17970ac0a8f2a2462f1bc4dacd324f6da0c4b408d442d4798913\\r\\n    OBS-Studio-33.0.1-Ubuntu-26.04-x86_64-dbsym.ddeb: fe45352bc671389178eed9d79c662727a011f266b0f5e65b92ca723b9740a889\\r\\n    OBS-Studio-33.0.1-Ubuntu-26.04-x86_64.deb: a9f062057576074439e6467f2716e3bbed6a0edab6ebf2c2f9595a3d2f1dc57f\\r\\n    OBS-Studio-33.0.1-Windows-arm64-PDBs.zip: 91c38b6cce8d82270af7dbbf0810c91927d9a1584de7a6e16909a9b519b05973\\r\\n    OBS-Studio-33.0.1-Windows-arm64.zip: 5bee731f6a9ce843ac670b4ccf048a54cdccb8b06acb3fd1c7928b9705f11100\\r\\n    OBS-Studio-33.0.1-Windows-x64-Installer.exe: 37ecde4d9a28e8aeeb07623c8469b5d558eb264e02ccf435bb859891c401758b\\r\\n    OBS-Studio-33.0.1-Windows-x64-PDBs.zip: f43a4360e894c952b97741d94dc3f1516a052ad7bf94ee2feaa5fd2a24bddc26\\r\\n    OBS-Studio-33.0.1-Windows-x64.zip: 0d9436451c2d772b33428e3fdae9776f071895c335de17283176306fb72651d3\\r\\n    OBS-Studio-33.0.1-macOS-Apple-dSYMs.tar.xz: f47fd8dfb1a1dfa938fc0b573da44088034296a2769943d84fcfb375cf3b32cc\\r\\n    OBS-Studio-33.0.1-macOS-Apple.dmg: 3d6b2eedeb56416602af635adaba32327fdf11ff9d2806a4ce7d5b608de73238\\r\\n    OBS-Studio-33.0.1-macOS-Intel-dSYMs.tar.xz: 6ee8ec85d80de024a9b60014675a6b054e060a302232e74760277fb1ef351b2d\\r\\n    OBS-Studio-33.0.1-macOS-Intel.dmg: 745257d65e06eb0f784af229659223a863ad50d036464bb2b52f8a2d9278c2b1\\r\\n\",\"reactions\":{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/obsproject/obs-studio/releases/428426144/reactions\",\"total_count\":59,\"+1\":25,\"-1\":0,\"laugh\":4,\"hooray\":6,\"confused\":0,\"heart\":13,\"rocket\":9,\"eyes\":2}}"
  }
